 03 0061) in the RS-10 Single-Unit Detached Residential zone. (With the following conditions...) (For the following reasons....)\r\n\r\n2) I move to (Approve) (Deny) the request for approval of a final plat a final plat for a proposed lot consolidation of four lots, 63, 64, 65, and part of 66, at 130 Wilmar Pl NW (0384 03 0063) in the RS-10 Single-Unit Detached Residential zone. (With the following conditions...) (For the following reasons....)\r\n\r\nThe Town Council may, of course, take other actions as the Town Council deems necessary.","EventItemPassedFlag":null,"EventItemPassedFlagName":null,"EventItemRollCallFlag":0,"EventItemFlagExtra":0,"EventItemTitle":"Request to Approve Final Plats for Two Lot Consolidations at 130 Wilmar Place NW - 1) Lots 61  and 62, and 2) Lots 63, 64, 65, and Part of 66, in the RS-10, Residential - Single-Unit, 10,000 sq. ft. Zone.","EventItemTally":null,"EventItemAccelaRecordId":null,"EventItemConsent":0,"EventItemMoverId":null,"EventItemMover":null,"EventItemSeconderId":null,"EventItemSeconder":null,"EventItemMatterId":6675,"EventItemMatterGuid":"3ABFC054-BE47-4B7A-8A56-5EC505AA303B","EventItemMatterFile":"24-4804","EventItemMatterName":null,"EventItemMatterType":"Action Item","EventItemMatterStatus":"Agenda Ready","EventItemMatterAttachments":[]},{"EventItemId":34573,"EventItemGuid":"D60864B8-76D2-48C7-AF5A-7456717CBA3D","EventItemLastModifiedUtc":"2024-12-30T21:18:16.433","EventItemRowVersion":"AAAAAABuLNY=","EventItemEventId":2600,"EventItemAgendaSequence":16,"EventItemMinutesSequence":16,"EventItemAgendaNumber":"A.","EventItemVideo":null,"EventItemVideoIndex":null,"EventItemVersion":"1","EventItemAgendaNote":null,"EventItemMinutesNote":null,"EventItemActionId":null,"EventItemActionName":null,"EventItemActionText":"* Option 1: \r\nI move that all the standard public improvements, including curb, gutter, and sidewalks, are necessary adjacent to 348 Windover Avenue NW, in association with the proposed redevelopment plan per the requirements of Town Code Section 18-402, Frontage Improvements, and that the Town's standard street profile for a street of this kind be implemented.\r\n\r\n* Option 2: \r\nI move that the following public improvements are necessary adjacent to 348 Windover Avenue NW, in association with the proposed redevelopment plan per the requirements of Town Code Section 18-402, Frontage Improvements, but that others are not necessary:\r\n_________ \r\n_________\r\n\r\n* Option 3: \r\nI move that public improvements are not necessary adjacent to 348 Windover Avenue NW, in association with the proposed redevelopment plan per the requirements of Town Code Section 18-402, Frontage Improvements, and that staff may approve a site plan without the standard street profile design.\r\n\r\n* Option 4: Other option that the Town Council may choose.","EventItemPassedFlag":null,"EventItemPassedFlagName":null,"EventItemRollCallFlag":0,"EventItemFlagExtra":0,"EventItemTitle":"Public Hearing on the Necessity of Public Improvements within the Windover Heights Historic District adjacent to and/or on the property located at 348 Windover Avenue NW.","EventItemTally":null,"EventItemAccelaRecordId":null,"EventItemConsent":0,"EventItemMoverId":null,"EventItemMover":null,"EventItemSeconderId":null,"EventItemSeconder":null,"EventItemMatterId":6676,"EventItemMatterGuid":"3EB8487D-C475-4565-A92B-87B57BF974AE","EventItemMatterFile":"24-4805","EventItemMatterName":null,"EventItemMatterType":"Action Item","EventItemMatterStatus":"Agenda Ready","EventItemMatterAttachments":[]},{"EventItemId":34574,"EventItemGuid":"1448BA01-4BFD-4C9A-ACDE-573C883D81D3","EventItemLastModifiedUtc":"2024-12-30T21:18:40.763","EventItemRowVersion":"AAAAAABuLT4=","EventItemEventId":2600,"EventItemAgendaSequence":19,"EventItemMinutesSequence":19,"EventItemAgendaNumber":"7.","EventItemVideo":null,"EventItemVideoIndex":null,"EventItemVersion":null,"EventItemAgendaNote":null,"EventItemMinutesNote":null,"EventItemActionId":null,"EventIte